     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi -- example files are here:<div><br></div><div><a href=\"http://phylo.wdfiles.com/local--files/biogeobears/Psychotria_5.2.newick\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://phylo.wdfiles.com/local--files/biogeobears/Psychotria_5.2.newick&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792485302099000&amp;usg=AOvVaw38dwpmL0FUcVAeqa9jRe8P\">http://phylo.wdfiles.com/local--files/biogeobears/Psychotria_5.2.newick</a><br></div><div><a href=\"http://phylo.wdfiles.com/local--files/biogeobears/Psychotria_geog.data\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://phylo.wdfiles.com/local--files/biogeobears/Psychotria_geog.data&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792485302099000&amp;usg=AOvVaw01rUK6ot3ud3_cknbZN7Ou\">http://phylo.wdfiles.com/local--files/biogeobears/Psychotria_geog.data</a><br></div><div><br></div><div>The geography file is tab-delimited, not comma-separated values (csv).  And the species names must have *NO* spaces.  For other details, see the file.<br></div><div><br></div><div>Cheers!</div><div>Nick</div><div><br></div></div><div class=\"gmail_extra\"><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"></div></div>"
    ],
